WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.540
It pitches first

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:14.550
One tap builds a whole game

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:33.570
Or ask for a whole game at once

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:36.600
The playtest fails — for real

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:40.250
It repairs its own work

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:43.680
It keeps pitching

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:49.360
One tap reverts the ask
